---
title: A fresh start
date: 2026-10-26
summary: The studio was rebuilt from zero, and the logbook starts again with it.
---
This week the site was rebuilt from zero. One grid, one typeface, one colour per project, and nothing on the page that doesn’t carry information.

The old version was dark, cinematic and scroll-driven. It was fun to build and slow to read. If someone has two minutes to understand what I do, the work should be the first thing they see, so that’s what this version puts first.

The old logbook entries didn’t make the move. This one is the new first page. The plan is one entry a week: what I built, what broke, and what I’d do differently.
